{"v":4,"catch":"您永遠不會忘記完美制勝一擊的那一天！","desc":"《SUPER WORLD COURT》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1993年發行的運動遊戲。\n它是「PRO TENNIS WORLD COURT」的序列，並增加了對 4 人同時遊戲的支援。\n擁有眾多各有專長的特色球員名單，這是您挑選自己喜歡的球員並在錦標賽中獲勝的機會！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-05-29","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1748b75be28e112b1325af2974b6d866f652635312b20ac66c183d85df0f2286.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6af7e30827ddd36e0450d8d151cbc140c15241ebd8e578f40a5dfa67aff9000b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3eeb8f8fac64f85a9e6a5bb1586a9abe8fc26cd296aec4cc3ee455e41f5f67c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c7424df0180b0b69874e420b1eb9d6b361e9ad8175f14ee8d7ba61364d53086.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5280b5df3b5a1788363569abe47f8fde82f5bcfcc85ed75b398763f204c91419.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/911bc9cf68780fc7e720cfc8958616d5e677cbcc49213aee7f5f8a78f881646c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bdc02151c000","dlc":[]}